    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.poster.avif?t=1724606096\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.webm?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.mp4?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Place stickers of hairdryers, dogs, cats, and other silliness to build imaginative paths for Hammy to traverse to his goal.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.poster.avif?t=1724606096\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.webm?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.mp4?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Guide Hammy through over 100 uniquely hand-crafted levels.<br></li><li>Discover the interesting and surprising uses of many unique stickers.<br></li><li>Get creative with your problem-solving and discover the silliest or the simplest solution to complete the puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.poster.avif?t=1724606096\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.webm?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/d310d2adc94dbfafccf69550772604dc.mp4?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Place stickers of hairdryers, dogs, cats, and other silliness to build imaginative paths for Hammy to traverse to his goal.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.poster.avif?t=1724606096\" width=454 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.webm?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840920/extras/3ea2eaf021dcdcb8a273e38cddb27f62.mp4?t=1724606096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Guide Hammy through over 100 uniquely hand-crafted levels.<br></li><li>Discover the interesting and surprising uses of many unique stickers.<br></li><li>Get creative with your problem-solving and discover the silliest or the simplest solution to complete the puzzles.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Roll is a creative puzzle game where you build contraptions out of stickers to roll, fling, and guide a hamster to its goal. Collect stickers as you complete puzzles, then build your own wacky contraptions for Hammy.",
